  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> is attached to one end of a string. The string is passed through a hollow tube and mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> is attached to the other end. Friction between the tube and string is negligible.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> travels at constant speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> in a horizontal circle of radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span>. What is mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv^{2}}{r}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mv^{2}rg\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mgv^{2}}{r}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv^{2}}{gr}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
